D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.Audit.d12_so3_bochner_audited	theorem	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.Audit	∀ (u : Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.Poly3),
  Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.Bochner.lap Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.crossDerivation
