D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.gA_half_mul_two	theorem	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.Bochner.gA (1 / 2) * 2 = 1
D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.gradSq_X0	theorem	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.Bochner.gradSq Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.crossDerivation
    (MvPolynomial.X 0) =
