D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.lap_X0_ne_zero	theorem	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.Bochner.lap Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.crossDerivation
