D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.polyVec._proof_2	theorem	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial	∀ (a : ℝ) (X : Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3.Vec3),
