D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial.rotVec_expand	theorem	Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3Polynomial	∀ (X : Poincare.D12.TensorMaximumBochner.So3.Vec3) (n : Fin 3),
