D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.chart_ibp	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.IBP	∀ {n : ℕ} (G : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric (n + 1)) (u v : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec (n + 1) → ℝ),
  ContDiff ℝ 2 u →
